Package: discwriter
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, xorriso
# xorriso is a hard dependency: every burn, erase, verify and drive scan
# shells out to it, and Disc Writer has no burning code of its own.
Description: Burn CDs, DVDs and Blu-ray discs on Linux
 Disc Writer is a modern disc burner for the Linux desktop, driving the
 xorriso command-line tool.
 .
 It builds data discs with a live capacity gauge and an exact pre-burn size
 check, appends sessions to discs that are still open, and verifies every
 burn: against recorded MD5 checksums for data discs, byte for byte for
 images. It also burns and saves ISO images, erases rewritable media, and
 can simulate any job with the laser off.
